      "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:02:47.123Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>We’re exploring adding an <strong>Employee Performance Dashboard</strong> inside <strong>POSNext</strong> to help sales staff track their daily and weekly sales, working hours, invoices handled, and overall performance directly from the POS UI.</p>\n<p>Example metrics being considered:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Daily, weekly, and monthly sales</li>\n<li>Hours worked or shift summary</li>\n<li>Number of invoices and returns</li>\n<li>Top selling items and categories</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Questions to the community:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Should this be part of POSNext core or a separate app?</li>\n<li>Which performance metrics matter most for sales staff?</li>\n<li>Should data be visible only to the logged in employee or also to managers?</li>\n<li>Would incentive or commission tracking be valuable?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Attached is an example UI for reference.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/c/9c8b96409c45b9904316b914531cbf4a4b53a134.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9c8b96409c45b9904316b914531cbf4a4b53a134\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/c/9c8b96409c45b9904316b914531cbf4a4b53a134_2_690x327.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mkRy2kFAS7qF7eQDkY26pFtVT0M\" width=\"690\" height=\"327\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/c/9c8b96409c45b9904316b914531cbf4a4b53a134_2_690x327.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/c/9c8b96409c45b9904316b914531cbf4a4b53a134_2_1035x490.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/c/9c8b96409c45b9904316b914531cbf4a4b53a134_2_1380x654.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D3D4D4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1911×908 120 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Would love your thoughts!</p>",
